to get memory report execute:


cd build
ninja partition_manager_report



  flash_primary (0x100000 - 1024kB): 
+-------------------------------------------------+
| 0x0: mcuboot (0x8000 - 32kB)                    |
+---0x8000: mcuboot_primary (0x7c000 - 496kB)-----+
| 0x8000: mcuboot_pad (0x200 - 512B)              |
+---0x8200: mcuboot_primary_app (0x7be00 - 495kB)-+
| 0x8200: app (0x7be00 - 495kB)                   |
+-------------------------------------------------+
| 0x84000: mcuboot_secondary (0x7c000 - 496kB)    |
+-------------------------------------------------+

  sram_primary (0x40000 - 256kB): 
+--------------------------------------------+
| 0x20000000: sram_primary (0x40000 - 256kB) |
+--------------------------------------------+
